   "schema:name": "PBA (M1)2(M2)2(M3)2[Fe(CN)6]3",
   "schema:description": "Product of the template reaction:PBA_Ferrocyanide_ThreeMetals: the Prussian blue analogue (M1)2(M2)2(M3)2[Fe(CN)6]3 (3 metals in equal amounts) from potassium ferrocyanide. Idealized composition: no potassium, water or vacancies in the lattice, the metals equimolar - the real composition of the precipitate is only known after its characterization (Laura Fadler, 05.10.2026). Resolved once per series."
  },
