   "schema:name": "PBA (M1)(M2)(M3)(M4)(M5)(M6)[Fe(CN)6]4",
   "schema:description": "Product of the template reaction:PBA_Ferricyanide_SixMetals: the Prussian blue analogue (M1)(M2)(M3)(M4)(M5)(M6)[Fe(CN)6]4 (6 metals in equal amounts) from potassium ferricyanide. Idealized composition: no potassium, water or vacancies in the lattice, the metals equimolar - the real composition of the precipitate is only known after its characterization (Laura Fadler, 05.10.2026). Resolved once per series."
